<%# Shared scan-quality tips for ID document uploads — surfaces the
    Amazon Rekognition best practices (all corners visible, natural light,
    JPG/PNG only) where the citizen is about to tap to capture. %>
<div class="mb-3 p-3 rounded-3"
     style="background: #ECFDF5; border: 1px solid #A7F3D0; color: #065F46; font-size: 0.78rem; line-height: 1.55;">
  <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
    <i class="ri-camera-3-line" style="font-size: 1rem; color: #059669;"></i>
    <strong>Konsèy pou yon bon foto</strong>
  </div>
  <ul class="mb-0" style="list-style: disc outside; padding-left: 1.25rem; margin-left: 0;">
    <li style="display: list-item;">Asire w tout 4 kwen dokiman an vizib, anyen pa koupe.</li>
    <li style="display: list-item;">Itilize limyè natirèl. Pa sèvi ak flach, li reflete sou plastik la.</li>
    <li style="display: list-item;">Itilize kamera telefòn ou pou pi bon kalite (JPG oswa PNG sèlman).</li>
  </ul>
</div>
